{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>中午12時許，一名女子由藍田啓田道59號啟田大廈高處墮下，倒臥平台，女事主昏迷由救護車送往聯合醫院，惜搶救後證實不治。警方初步調查，相信73歲姓邱女事主從一單位墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書。</p>\n<h2>防止自殺求助熱線</h2>\n<p>「情緒通」精神健康支援熱線及WhatsApp：18111</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.040256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:53:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:40.298947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:59.776701+00:00","content_hash":"2dc14124cd70ae0347cd9293b0b89ff21b2906dcaf9f068b4c47167c64a8c54c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}